abstract: >-
  Computational companion code, frozen numerical results, and publication
  figures for integrated isoconversional kinetics (FWO, KAS, Starink) and
  complete-heating-rate-holdout machine learning for thermogravimetric
  analysis of Arab Light crude under nitrogen and air atmospheres.
